Requirement 3 points at `~/Documents/workspaces/agent-task-executor/hack/` and `~/Documents/workspaces/go-skeleton/hack/` as the offline fallback. I verified that path does not exist on this host (`ls ~/Documents/workspaces` → no such file or directory), and it cannot exist inside the dark-factory container. If GitHub is unreachable, the prompt has no viable path and the agent is likely to hand-write files — which requirement 3 forbids. This is a path-portability + stale-reference violation.

Recommended replacement:
```text
